%% Platform experience — tenant branding & the document engine (Phase 10, ADR 0039)
flowchart TD
    subgraph BRANDING [Tenant branding — white-label config, never a boundary]
      CP[(tenant_company_profiles<br/>name · address · tax label · footer · colours)]
      TA[(tenant_assets · logo/favicon<br/>bytes in object storage, key only in DB)]
      TO[(tenant_onboarding · dismissed_at only)]
      CP --- RLS{{ENABLE + FORCE RLS<br/>tenant_id = app.tenant_id}}
      TA --- RLS
      TO --- RLS
    end

    CP --> BR[/GET /settings/branding · /auth/me.active.branding/]
    TA --> LOGO[/GET /settings/company/logo · authenticated stream/]
    BR --> SHELL[Web app shell<br/>name + logo · Aivoryx-safe fallback]
    BR --> TOKEN[BrandProvider<br/>--primary / --ring token override<br/>contrast-clamped · no arbitrary CSS]

    CP --> OBD[GET /onboarding<br/>steps DERIVED · RBAC-filtered links]
    OBD --> CARD[OnboardingCard · resumable · skippable]

    subgraph ENGINE [Reusable document engine — implemented once]
      DTO[Business detail DTO<br/>immutable issued snapshot] --> BLD[builders.ts<br/>build&lt;Type&gt;Document · recompute nothing]
      BLD --> DEF[DocumentDefinition<br/>generic: title · meta · party · lines · totals]
      DEF --> RS[DocumentRenderService.render scope, def]
      CP --> DB2[getDocumentBranding tx, tenantId]
      TA --> DB2
      DB2 --> RS
      RS --> PDF[DocumentPdfService.render<br/>*** only place PDF tech lives ***<br/>pdfmake · pure Node · no headless browser]
    end

    PDF --> DL[/GET .../pdf · .../receipt.pdf/]
    DL --> RESP[application/pdf<br/>Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=INV-000123.pdf<br/>server-derived tenant · 404 cross-tenant · 401 anon]

    CP --> EMAIL[brandedEmailHtml<br/>escaped body + accent bar + Powered by Aivoryx™]
    EMAIL --> N[Phase 8 email channel · no tenant HTML]
